Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:37.63,1:17:39.01,65c9a9649fa035ac5edf59dd,Umputun,0,0,0,,Ну да.
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:39.05,1:17:40.99,65c9a9649fa035ac5edf59de,Umputun,0,0,0,,Умеет оно C++, понимает Go, Java, Python, Ruby, SQL.
